4:b004:l032","ordinal":178122,"en":"Kelbersigen Sherry is available."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l033","ordinal":178123,"en":"He is alive without dying,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l034","ordinal":178124,"en":"There is a Bakai word."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l035","ordinal":178125,"en":"Do not judge my servant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l036","ordinal":178126,"en":"Bloodthirsty"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l037","ordinal":178127,"en":"He has black eyes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l038","ordinal":178128,"en":"Your father's murder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1334:b004:l039","ordinal":178129,"en":"What the lion did"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l001","ordinal":178130,"en":"Inscribed in its register."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l002","ordinal":178131,"en":"When the following year comes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l003","ordinal":178132,"en":"Take male camels from the herds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l004","ordinal":178133,"en":"Take plenty of every kind of equipment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l005","ordinal":178134,"en":"Take a full count of the army,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l006","ordinal":178135,"en":"And enter the army on the rolls."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l007","ordinal":178136,"en":"Leaving out no able-bodied man,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l008","ordinal":178137,"en":"Let us gather them all!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l009","ordinal":178138,"en":"Making the face of the earth thunder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l010","ordinal":178139,"en":"Then let us go to Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l011","ordinal":178140,"en":"Those who go on holy war may die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l012","ordinal":178141,"en":"The brave scout will reconnoiter the road."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l013","ordinal":178142,"en":"So the people who go need burden no one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l014","ordinal":178143,"en":"And their lice do not multiply,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l015","ordinal":178144,"en":"Let us prepare underclothing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l016","ordinal":178145,"en":"To enter battle fully equipped,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l017","ordinal":178146,"en":"To strike the foe without tiring,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l018","ordinal":178147,"en":"Let us ready armor against bullets!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l019","ordinal":178148,"en":"The Chinese inhabit Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l020","ordinal":178149,"en":"Whose heat gives no respite."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l021","ordinal":178150,"en":"Beijing is no easy place;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l022","ordinal":178151,"en":"For every man let us prepare"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l023","ordinal":178152,"en":"A coat with golden collar and copper sleeves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l024","ordinal":178153,"en":"For him to cast himself against the foe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l025","ordinal":178154,"en":"To stand fighting the enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l026","ordinal":178155,"en":"To extend his spear without fleeing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l027","ordinal":178156,"en":"Let it be a coat bullets cannot pierce."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l028","ordinal":178157,"en":"Who then will have great regret,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l029","ordinal":178158,"en":"If we stand and fight without fleeing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l030","ordinal":178159,"en":"And bring great conflict upon the Kakan?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l031","ordinal":178160,"en":"If we stand face to face,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l032","ordinal":178161,"en":"Clashing and hewing with swords,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l033","ordinal":178162,"en":"Bathed in red blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l034","ordinal":178163,"en":"Standing amid slaughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l035","ordinal":178164,"en":"Swallowing the Kara-Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l036","ordinal":178165,"en":"If we stand and fight without fleeing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l037","ordinal":178166,"en":"So we do not die by the sword,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l038","ordinal":178167,"en":"So untimely death does not reach us,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b003:l039","ordinal":178168,"en":"Your dear father's contemporary,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l001","ordinal":178169,"en":"That confidant Bölökbai—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l002","ordinal":178170,"en":"When he worked the bellows, it stirred;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l003","ordinal":178171,"en":"Döötü and Bölökbai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l004","ordinal":178172,"en":"Were friends for the world beyond."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l005","ordinal":178173,"en":"Skilled in every kind of object,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l006","ordinal":178174,"en":"What Bölökbai made,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l007","ordinal":178175,"en":"He and Döötü together"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1335:b004:l008","ordinal":178176,"en":"Made after taking counsel."}]
